<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - H.F. Ahmanson upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - H.F. Ahmanson upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it upgraded H.F. Ahmanson and Co to market outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares gained 3/4 to 32-3/4 early.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
